# vanilla-extract

- Colocate styles: `{Component}.css.ts` next to `{Component}/index.tsx`
- Shared tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css.ts`; theme vars in `src/styles/theme.css.ts`
- Use `style()` for one-off styles, `recipe()` for variant-based components (size, intent)
- Use `sprinkles()` for utility-style responsive/layout props when appropriate
- Compose with antd via `className` — never override antd internals with global CSS
- Export style objects/recipes as named exports; import in component as `import * as styles from './Component.css'`
- No CSS modules, Tailwind, styled-components, or inline styles in components
- Use design tokens for colors/spacing — no hardcoded hex values in component styles

For good/bad examples, read `examples/rules/vanilla-extract.md` when applying this rule.
